      "writtenOn": "2026-09-15T11:14:49Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Seems like a reasonable note. Does this need to be addressed?\n\nFrom AI Agent:\n\nSince mIssueFIRByAssembler was also enabled for H.265 and H.263, do AHEVCAssembler and AH263Assembler suffer from the exact same FIR flooding issue if they start receiving P-frames before an in-band VPS/SPS? Please verify if a similar check is needed in those assemblers to prevent them from flooding the server.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 92,
        "startChar": 8,
        "endLine": 92,
        "endChar": 36
      },
      "revId": "57fbb9c5ffa6767c6245c884ce4c1c1754301537",
